{"id":"turn-on","name":"Turn On","tagline":"Turn on devices in your network","blurb":"Conveniently turn on devices in your network, such as a NAS or a gaming console, using Wake On LAN (WoL).","description":"Conveniently turn on devices in your network, such as a NAS or a gaming console,\nusing Wake On LAN (WoL).\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Add devices to turn on.\n\n• Discover devices in the local network.\n\n• Discover web interfaces on devices.\n\n• Monitor device status.\n\n• Turn on devices with magic Wake On LAN (WoL) packets.\n\n• Turn on devices from GNOME Shell search.\n\n• Turn on devices from the command line.","developer":"Sebastian Wiesner","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/de/swsnr/turnon/d3ed3afc82ec95c3d39e6a77f10f5980/icons/128x128/de.swsnr.turnon.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/de/swsnr/turnon/d3ed3afc82ec95c3d39e6a77f10f5980/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/de/swsnr/turnon/d3ed3afc82ec95c3d39e6a77f10f5980/screenshots/image-1_224x224@1.png","w":602,"h":602},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/de/swsnr/turnon/d3ed3afc82ec95c3d39e6a77f10f5980/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/de/swsnr/turnon/d3ed3afc82ec95c3d39e6a77f10f5980/screenshots/image-2_224x224@1.png","w":602,"h":602},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/de/swsnr/turnon/d3ed3afc82ec95c3d39e6a77f10f5980/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/de/swsnr/turnon/d3ed3afc82ec95c3d39e6a77f10f5980/screenshots/image-3_224x283@1.png","w":602,"h":762},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/de/swsnr/turnon/d3ed3afc82ec95c3d39e6a77f10f5980/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/de/swsnr/turnon/d3ed3afc82ec95c3d39e6a77f10f5980/screenshots/image-4_224x224@1.png","w":602,"h":602}],"categories":["Networking","Utilities"],"tags":["utility"],"license":"EUPL-1.2","platforms":["linux"],"homepage":"https://codeberg.org/swsnr/turnon","stars":null,"version":"3.2.0","update